I think I disagree with this, but I think you have to take team build into consideration as well. One of the advantages of 5 vs. 3 is that you have a higher chance of diversity in the team. Some people will get going quick, and others won&#39;t. I don&#39;t find Tempest, AZ, and Bunker to be a good team, at least against Voss. You just end up relying on Tempest too much while Bunker and AZ get set up, but add Ra and Haka to the mix, you now have some characters to help Tempest control the tide while Bunker and AZ prepare for the long game.

